        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knob with Rope Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Crystal Biarritz Knob with Newport Rosette has a lovely, traditional feel. The clear crystal knob and rope rose pair together beautifully--no wonder this style is a classic. The Biarritz Knob has been designed to catch the light in a room. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This knobset will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWBIA Rope Newport Rosette With Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Newport Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Biarritz Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Newport Rosette With Crystal Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Depth:  2.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWBIA-specifications.pdf?v=1704262319\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur NEWBIA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Crystal Biarritz Knob with Newport Rosette",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knob with Newport Rosette - The Crystal Biarritz Knob with Newport Rosette has a lovely, traditional feel. The clear crystal knob and rope rose pair together beautifully--no wonder this style is a classic. The Biarritz Knob has been designed to catch the light in a room. It is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. This knobset will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick. with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
